# overload_resolution_ambiguity — function overload resolution
# (README §8). Tests overload resolution and ambiguity detection.

OverloadResolutionAmbiguity is project
OverloadResolutionAmbiguity module examplesOverloadResolutionAmbiguity
OverloadResolutionAmbiguity target console
OverloadResolutionAmbiguity entry main

examplesOverloadResolutionAmbiguity is module
examplesOverloadResolutionAmbiguity path examples.overloadResolutionAmbiguity
examplesOverloadResolutionAmbiguity exports main
examplesOverloadResolutionAmbiguity purpose "Demonstrate overload resolution"
examplesOverloadResolutionAmbiguity invariant "Overload resolution is unambiguous"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Resolve function overloads"
main invariant "Overload resolution works"

main let resolved immutable Int64 1
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0

main do printResolved
main return okCode

printResolved is call
printResolved in main
printResolved invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printResolved arg value Int64 resolved
